  "bodyHash": "a8f626f7142d28f6",
  "content": "\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\">MOA DECOR: 浴室</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">这是一个装饰模组，旨在为建筑添加全新浴室主题的物品。目前已有多个模组添加了家具，本模组旨在作为它们的又一补充，因为你可以找到数百种不同的物品和元素来装饰你的世界。它是 </span></em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">MOA DECOR</span></em></span></strong></span><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"> 系列的又一成员。</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/635/moa-sanitario7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1465\" height=\"672\"></span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">合成</span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/932/c-sanitario-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"477\" height=\"231\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">模组中的所有物品均可在生存模式中获得。要开始制作这些物品，你必须在合成台中放置一个<strong>浅蓝色</strong>染料和一个绿宝石，这样你将获得<strong>9个浴室宝石</strong>。利用这些宝石与其他材料合成，即可获取各种装饰物品。<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>共有162种不同物品！</strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/933/c-sanitario-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"477\" height=\"232\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>示例：</strong>如果你想制作马桶模型，除了该物品所需的额外材料（本例中为一个铁块、一个石质按钮、一个抛光闪长岩块和一个水桶）外，还必须使用一个浴室宝石。此外，还有部分二级合成配方是由两个模型的物品组合而成的。在这些情况下，则不需要使用宝石，因为它已在之前的合成中消耗过了。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/934/moa-sanitario1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"476\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/935/moa-sanitario2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"492\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/936/moa-sanitario3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"470\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/937/moa-sanitario4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"481\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/938/moa-sanitario5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"610\"></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/634/moa-sanitario6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1465\" height=\"811\"></em></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/636/moa-sanitario8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1171\" height=\"753\"></em></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><em>注意：</em></strong></span><em>为了获得更完整的游戏体验，建议查看 </em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><em>MOA DECOR</em></strong></span><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>系列</strong></span>中的其他模组，其中包含更多可与此模组互补的分类。</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 烹饪\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 艺术\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 科学\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 玩具\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 浴室\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 灯光\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
